      "notes": [
        "FACE REFERENCE drives FaceID and final ReActor identity.",
        "POSE / ACTION REFERENCE is resized to ~1 MP and extracted with DWPose body+hands only; pose-face landmarks stay disabled to avoid conflicts on occluded or rear-angle poses.",
        "A fresh latent prevents the pose image background from anchoring the requested scene.",
        "OpenPose Control-LoRA defaults to strength 1.0 through 90%; Butler can adjust both values.",
        "FaceID now fades out by 45% so it establishes identity without overpowering extreme body geometry; ReActor restores the face after decode.",
        "Exactly one CLIPTextEncode positive and one CLIPTextEncode negative.",
        "Requires control-lora-openposeXL2-rank256.safetensors under ComfyUI/models/controlnet."
      ]
    }
